; dns-01 validation zone. Nothing else has to live here: ACME clients add and
; remove `_acme-challenge` TXT records, Chancery reads them from this server.
; Rename the zone (also in named.conf.template) to the domain your
; certificates use. The serial is bumped by BIND itself on dynamic updates.
$TTL 60
@       IN  SOA  dns.example.lan. hostmaster.example.lan. (
                 2026091801  ; serial
                 3600        ; refresh
                 600         ; retry
                 86400       ; expire
                 60 )        ; negative-answer TTL (short: a "not yet" is retried quickly)
@       IN  NS   dns.example.lan.
dns     IN  A    192.0.2.53  ; this server's LAN address — informational for a private validation zone
